  "evidenceNotes": [
    "Pinned BWAPI4.4.0/OpenBW facts: Optical75energy/288px/1800frames, Restoration50energy/192px/1200frames. Each Academy research costs100/100 and uses half economic time750/500ticks. Blind sight is2tiles, detection is disabled, and Restoration clears blindness without affecting HP,Stim,Stasis or cloak.",
    "Authored scope: immediate single nonbuilding visible ground/air organic/mechanical own/enemy target, self/repeat casts legal, reject out-of-range without approach, fixed18tick shared spell cooldown without original random jitter or animation windup. Successful cast clears healing/movement and gives20tick auto-heal grace. No spell autocast.",
    "Blindness persists after source death, through cargo/Stasis and unit morphs. A blinded Drone retains status during construction and cancellation; completed building clears it. Incomplete structures do not use the mobile-unit blindness rendering/sight override.",
    "596 game tests pass, including21 new tests for spells, range/energy boundaries, sight/detection, status and order interactions, Drone lifecycle, partial Stim semantics, deterministic continuation and validated migration. Shared250,Haeru47,Baksal28 checks pass. Canonical CI repeats fresh install,full tests,lab build and benchmark.",
    "Both portrait sizes locally and on production run actual Worker/Pixi/native touch, paid normal-time750/500tick research, ground mechanical group target at360px and air mechanical target at390px, permanent blindness with no damage, distinct second Medic Restoration, observed effects and exact paused status/energy/orders/RNG save/reload. No new-game resource/state injection.",
    "Sixteen untouched production saves from formats12..20 restore locally and on production at exact ticks, including active/refreshed Stim and manual Medic jobs, energy upgrades, cargo/cloak/siege/morphs, paid pending spells and group preferences. Original raw save bytes are retained; no Medic spell state,research,resources or units are granted.",
    "Existing full Medic flow, Stim/Medic recovery, opt-in automatic Stasis and manual Recall/Stasis remain functional. The latter waits full873tick thaw and restored movement.",
    "Every archive file SHA256-matches a clean canonical build. Lossless concatenated gzip members fit32MiB without asset changes. Sites source push, saved version, native successful deployment and public buildId all match canonical commit.",
    "The initial additional Drone regression used an invalid command payload; it was corrected to the actual point target schema and passed. No application changes were needed to fix that test fixture. The corrected regression and successful rerun are retained.",
    "Chromium SwiftShader/native touch does not certify physical Android/iOS devices or hardware GPU performance. Portrait only remains enforced. Final graphics and strategic opponent AI are outside this stage."
  ]
